time around it’s Toy meets Tech. Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang’s jobs get exponentially harder when they go head to head with this all-new threat to playtime.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The toys are back in Disney and Pixar’s “Toy Story 5,” and this time around it’s Toy meets Tech. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":102,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/3e6d64d4-c466-4c58-93cd-ce8d7c41f210/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GM3Dmn06fy8\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GM3Dmn06fy8\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002191\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003325\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005692\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006291\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009763\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013297\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013298\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013314\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013315\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013316\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002191\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003325\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005692\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006291\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009763\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013314\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013297\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013315\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013298\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013316\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000003\",\"0000000007\",\"0000000025\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"3e6d64d4-c466-4c58-93cd-ce8d7c41f210\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006825\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008421\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006909\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Devil Wears Prada 2\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Twenty years after making their iconic turns as Miranda, Andy, Emily and Nigel—Meryl Streep, Anne Hathaway, Emily Blunt and Stanley Tucci return to the fashionable streets of New York City and the sleek offices of Runway Magazine in 20th Century Studios’ “The Devil Wears Prada 2,” the eagerly awaited sequel to the 2006 phenomenon that defined a generation. The film is directed by David Frankel, written by Aline Brosh McKenna, produced by Wendy Finerman, and executive produced by Michael Bederman, Karen Rosenfelt and Aline Brosh McKenna. \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Twenty years after making their iconic turns as Miranda, Andy, Emily and Nigel—Meryl Streep, Anne Hathaway, Emily Blunt and Stanley Tucci return to the fashionable street\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-01\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":119,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/2f8e91fc-f1ef-42d9-b846-6f9157e62a6b/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gFJIo2aoP24\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gFJIo2aoP24\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000341\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000417\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004443\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009402\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013582\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000370\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000341\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000417\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004443\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000370\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013582\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009402\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"2f8e91fc-f1ef-42d9-b846-6f9157e62a6b\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006909\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008520\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006931\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Disclosure Day\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"If you found out we weren’t alone, if someone showed you, proved it to you, would that frighten you? This June, the truth belongs to seven billion people.\\n\\nWe are coming close to … Disclosure Day.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"If you found out we weren’t alone, if someone showed you, proved it to you, would that frighten you? This June, the truth belongs to seven billion people.\\n\\nWe are coming.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-10\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":145,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/920be864-1bc7-4cfd-aa64-b828b3c90b38/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pFz8czbdPdU\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pFz8czbdPdU\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000341\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001072\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002139\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008293\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013627\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000341\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000418\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001072\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008293\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013627\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002139\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000035\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"920be864-1bc7-4cfd-aa64-b828b3c90b38\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006931\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008544\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007012\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Moana\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In Disney’s live-action adaptation of the beloved Oscar®-nominated animated adventure, Moana (Catherine Lagaʻaia) answers the Ocean’s call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with the infamous demigod Maui (Dwayne Johnson) on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people. The film is directed by Emmy® and Tony Award® winner Thomas Kail (“Hamilton”); produced by Dwayne Johnson, Dany Garcia, Beau Flynn, Hiram Garcia and Lin-Manuel Miranda; and executive produced by Thomas Kail, Scott Sheldon, Charles Newirth and Auliʻi Cravalho, who voiced Moana in the animated features “Moana” and “Moana 2.”\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In Disney’s live-action adaptation of the beloved Oscar®-nominated animated adventure, Moana (Catherine Lagaʻaia) answers the Ocean’s call and, for the first time, voyage\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-10\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":120,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/a7437e11-b6d4-476f-89ac-5a3a2ee813c8/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider