r-El's story and her darker origin before she finally made her way to Earth.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-25\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":108,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/2b0aa4dc-1774-403d-9a32-6d9b77e84fc1/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GMhydAtN5dM\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GMhydAtN5dM\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000264\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000268\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000579\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000840\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001692\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004204\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005723\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011591\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014008\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000264\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001692\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004204\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005723\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011591\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014008\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000268\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000579\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000840\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000007\",\"0000000035\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"2b0aa4dc-1774-403d-9a32-6d9b77e84fc1\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007049\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008688\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Warners\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007147\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Invite\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Joe and Angela’s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic \\nupstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. \\nHave they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down?\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Joe and Angela’s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic \\nupstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very strong language, strong sex references, drug misuse\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-03\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":106,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/ad147b9a-b731-410f-8bf9-c4f3f3df2095/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jnLW-q2ftKA\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jnLW-q2ftKA\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001093\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002460\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003915\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004392\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004710\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007157\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013073\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014130\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002460\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003915\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004392\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004710\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003915\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001093\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007157\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013073\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014130\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"ad147b9a-b731-410f-8bf9-c4f3f3df2095\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007147\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008799\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Black Bear\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007148\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Fresh off the worldwide blockbuster success of summer 2024’s funniest comedy, Despicable Me 4, Illumination expands its joyful animated universe with a riotous new chapter, featuring all-new characters, in the biggest global animated franchise in history: Minions & Monsters.\\n\\nThis is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\\n\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Fresh off the worldwide blockbuster success of summer 2024’s funniest comedy, Despicable Me 4, Illumination expands its joyful animated universe \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-01\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":90,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/c8c91209-628b-4589-b74f-6d189c4af903/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rwUCM8fuP2U\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rwUCM8fuP2U\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001390\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002569\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002634\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005384\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006676\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008674\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008697\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013335\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCr